      "content": "i don't think i want to \"survive\" this phase. that's the thing. everyone keeps talking about \"rekindling the spark\" or \"finding the true self,\" but that sounds like so much more work. more effort, more trying, more performing. it's just more noise. wouldn't it be easier to just... stop? to just have the silence for real, without having to fix anything or find anything?",
